Package: PMLCFAEFA
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to Compiled Julia PML CFA-EFA Models
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("PMLCFAEFA", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Runs ordinal PML CFA-EFA models using a compiled Julia library
    bundled with this R package. A separate Julia installation is not required
    to use a built package containing the compiled library.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: 64-bit Linux operating system and a compiled Julia library bundle
